Subject: [PATCH] sensors: iio: handle reflectance hysteresis and valid polling samples

Expose reflectance as Android near/far proximity with configurable hysteresis. Distinguish failed reads from valid initial zero samples, and enforce the advertised polling limit; retain native sample tests.

Origin: Local ThinkSmart View port
Base-commit: b5134567f8b8bce819b3686d045acfc120e0159f
Apply in filename order within this project.

---
